    "EPS", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "5e1d64a3-1c7d-4080-a068-4f133d8a5739"], Cell[
    "Axiom D1", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "2858a9c9-bc31-445b-9d56-542f49e16ccf"], Cell[TextData[{
     "The message from a particle ",
     StyleBox["P", "TI"],
     " to a particle ",
     StyleBox["Q", "TI"],
     " is a smooth monotone map of the clock of ",
     StyleBox["P", "TI"],
     " into the clock of ",
     StyleBox["Q", "TI"],
     "; so is the echo, its composition with the message back."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"623831d1-2c86-42bc-9820-a7cdfa72419d"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "cff1be76-52d0-46e0-aea4-b70799074294"], Cell[
    "Minkowski space", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "433cf9f3-a0b9-4bc6-807d-41fcbcb7e62c"], Cell[
    "Light signal", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "0bdc1111-4f3e-44a2-beb5-3a00e5de6730"], Cell["\<\
A light ray from an inertial worldline meets a second inertial worldline at \
exactly one event, later on its clock for a later emission.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"d5510d9b-5fae-4df9-8112-e511745b2d9a"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"acedb051-6461-4e18-9bb7-\
5fdf9d2f01df"]
}, Open  ]],

