Cell["\<\
Two random timelike geodesics on each substrate: a light ray from a tick \
rarely meets the other observer in exactly one tick, and the axiom fails for \
messages and echoes on all three.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"272ebcd5-dcb4-4d0b-b606-2e237f7d91a2"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Table", "[", "\n", "  ", 
